<p><strong>Focus on CTR within the first 24 hours</strong>—if CTR drops below 0.8% within 6 hours, pause and swap creatives immediately. Don't wait three days.</p>
<p><strong>Checklist:</strong><br />
- [ ] Creatives grouped by type/framework<br />
- [ ] Each test group daily budget ≥$20<br />
- [ ] Underperforming creatives (CTR &lt;0.8%) paused within 24 hours</p>
